#. copy/eyebrow
#: src/js/fieldwork.js:47
msgctxt "tree:copy#/eyebrow"
msgid "FIELDWORK PASSPORT / DOMESTIC PLACEMENT × FIELD INQUIRY"
msgstr "FIELDWORK PASSPORT / 幻想郷域内実習 × フィールド調査"

#. copy/title
#: src/js/fieldwork.js:47
msgctxt "tree:copy#/title"
msgid "A map says how to go. A passport remembers why, what you saw, and who disagreed."
msgstr "地図は行き方を示す。旅券は、なぜ行き、何を見て、誰が異議を唱えたかまで覚える。"

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/fieldwork.js:47
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Twenty-four stations have their own entry rules, supervisors, and "
"complications. Obtain dispatch, check in, respond when something refuses to "
"follow the plan, then return with observations, provenance, and a decision "
"on research use."
msgstr ""
"二十四の実習所には、それぞれ異なる入場規則と指導者、厄介事がある。派遣令を受け、現地で点呼し、予定どおりには起きない一件に対処したうえで、観察記録・来歴"
"・研究利用の判断を持ち帰る。"

